# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Backend — Business Suite (TEMPLATE FILE — COMMITTED TO GIT)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# INSTRUCTIONS:
#   1. Copy this file and name the copy ".env" (NO .example suffix!)
#      → Windows:  copy .env.example .env
#      → Git Bash: cp .env.example .env
#   2. Fill in REAL VALUES below (passwords, secrets, etc.)
#   3. NEVER commit the real ".env" file — it is gitignored!
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Runtime ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=5000

# ── Database ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local PostgreSQL 18 installation (default user postgres on port 5432)
# PASSWORD = whatever you set during PostgreSQL install step 5 (e.g. postgres123)
# For Neon/Supabase REMOTE managed databases, replace full connection string below:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/business_suite?schema=public&pgbouncer=true&sslmode=require
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:YOUR_POSTGRES_PASSWORD_HERE@localhost:5432/business_suite?schema=public

# ── JWT Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⚠️ Generate YOUR OWN random strings, 64 chars each. MINIMUM 32 chars STRONG SECRET.
# Generate in PowerShell:
#   -join ((48..57) + (65..90) + (97..122) | Get-Random -Count 64 | % {[char]$_})
# Generate in Bash:
#   openssl rand -hex 32
# Must be DIFFERENT values for ACCESS vs REFRESH.
JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=replace_me_with_a_random_64_char_string_FOR_ACCESS_TOKENS
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=replace_me_with_a_DIFFERENT_random_64_char_string_FOR_REFRESH_TOKENS

# ── Token Expiry ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRES_IN=15m
REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRES_IN=7d

# ── CORS & Cookies ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
COOKIE_DOMAIN=localhost

# ── Rate Limiting ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=900000
RATE_LIMIT_MAX=100
